<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-21072] build: DKMS client build fails without /lib/modules/&lt;ver&gt;/source</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21072</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;lustre-dkms_pre-build.sh uses /lib/modules/&amp;lt;ver&amp;gt;/source for --with-linux without checking it exists. Since Linux 6.6 (d8131c2965d5) that symlink is no longer created, so installing lustre-client-dkms on such kernels fails:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="codeContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre class="code-java"&gt;
# ll /lib/modules/7.0.0/ | grep source
&amp;lt;nothing&amp;gt;

# rpm -ivh lustre-client-dkms-2.17.60_72_g40b80bc-1.el10.noarch.rpm
Verifying...                          ################################# [100%]
Preparing...                          ################################# [100%]
Updating / installing...
   1:lustre-client-dkms-2.17.60_72_g40################################# [100%]
Loading &lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; lustre-client/2.17.60_72_g40b80bc DKMS files...
Building &lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; 7.0.0Building initial module lustre-client/2.17.60_72_g40b80bc &lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; 7.0.0
Sign command: /lib/modules/7.0.0/build/scripts/sign-file
Signing key: /&lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;var&lt;/span&gt;/lib/dkms/mok.key
Public certificate (MOK): /&lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;var&lt;/span&gt;/lib/dkms/mok.pubRunning the pre_build script.......(bad exit status: 1)
Failed command:
cd /&lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;var&lt;/span&gt;/lib/dkms/lustre-client/2.17.60_72_g40b80bc/build/ &amp;amp;&amp;amp; /&lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;var&lt;/span&gt;/lib/dkms/lustre-client/2.17.60_72_g40b80bc/build/lustre-dkms_pre-build.sh lustre-client 2.17.60_72_g40b80bc 7.0.0 /lib/modules/7.0.0/build x86_64 /usr/src /&lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;var&lt;/span&gt;/lib/dkms
Consult /&lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;var&lt;/span&gt;/lib/dkms/lustre-client/2.17.60_72_g40b80bc/build/make.log &lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; more information.
warning: %post(lustre-client-dkms-2.17.60_72_g40b80bc-1.el10.noarch) scriptlet failed, exit status 1

# grep error /&lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;var&lt;/span&gt;/lib/dkms/lustre-client/2.17.60_72_g40b80bc/build/make.log
configure: error: Kernel source /usr/lib/modules/7.0.0/source could not be found.
configure error, check /&lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;var&lt;/span&gt;/lib/dkms/lustre-client/2.17.60_72_g40b80bc/build/config.log&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
